<title>RUSSIA: Russian wage arrears rise in September.</title>
<headline>Russian wage arrears rise in September.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian wage arrears due to a lack of financing from the federal or regional governments rose to 7.01 trillion roubles on September 23 from 6.11 trillion roubles on August 26, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN WAGE ARREARS	     Sept 23     Aug 26</p>
<p>    wage arrears (government)	  7,012	6,107</p>
<p>    wage arrears (companies)	  33,223     29,915</p>
<p>    wage arrears (total)		40,235     36,022</p>
<p>NOTE - figures in billions of roubles.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
